## Why This Is Asked
This question assesses practical ability to plan beginner-friendly performance tests for a streaming ingestion path with backpressure.

## Key Concepts
- Workload modeling, RPS targets, tail latency
- Backpressure indicators: Kafka producer lag, broker queue depth
- Tooling and basic data generation

